    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>Your eidolon is a mystical beast steeped in knowledge. These eidolons most often resemble the form of a lion with the wings of a mighty falcon and the head of a human. Sphinx eidolons most often come to bond with humanoids they find interesting, either for the humanoid themself or for where they might travel.</p><p><strong>Tradition</strong> Occult</p><p><strong>Traits</strong> beast, eidolon, sphinx</p><p><strong>Home Plane</strong> the Universe</p><hr /><p><strong>Size</strong> Medium or Small</p><p><strong>Suggested Attacks</strong> claw (slashing), jaw (piercing), wing (bludgeoning)</p><p><strong>Eidolon Attributes</strong> <em>Con</em> +0, <em>Int</em> +3, <em>Wis</em> +0, <em>Cha</em> +0</p><p><strong>Skills</strong> Occultism, Society</p><p><strong>Senses</strong> darkvision</p><p><strong>Language</strong> Sphinx</p><p><strong>Speed</strong> 25 feet</p><hr /><p><strong>Initial (1st) @UUID[Compendium.pf2e-sovereign.su-eidolons.Item.FLIU1atD9oEDz0Hi]{Riddlemaster}</strong></p><p><strong>Symbiosis (7th) @UUID[Compendium.pf2e-sovereign.su-eidolons.Item.Bbyz3uFD1xnMPj4r]{Befuddling Knowledge}</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span></p><p><strong>Transcendence (17th) @UUID[Compendium.pf2e-sovereign.su-eidolons.Item.tYQ4HdclpdrfqoXy]{Words of the Ancients}</strong></p><hr /><p>The summoner's half of this eidolon is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e-sovereign.summons-unleashed.Item.x2AlARtkCJnDdMCm]{Sphinx Eidolon} in the Summons Unleashed compendium.</p>"
